rison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/m42.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/m42.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/m50.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/m50.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-end-of-life-replacement.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-end-of-life-replacement.md","line":117,"text":"For a written retirement protocol for your line, send the knife inventory, current chip event rate, current re-grind count distribution and current scrap rate to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mai"},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-end-of-life-replacement.md","line":121,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-preventive-schedule.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-preventive-schedule.md","line":176,"text":"For a written PM schedule for your line, send the line layout, the current knife consumption, the current downtime and the current scrap rate to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@k"},{"file":"src/data/post/maintenance-preventive-schedule.md","line":180,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9