le chemistry, and a heat-treatment certificate documenting t"},{"file":"src/data/post/material-grade-converter.md","line":202,"text":"For deeper field guidance, see the individual material-family comparisons linked above and the broader [five-factor selection framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/material-grade-converter.md","line":208,"text":"For a written cross-reference table for a specific RFQ, or a quotation against your warehouse stock in any of the four major systems, send the part drawing and the requested grade to [engineering@kaip"},{"file":"src/data/post/material-grade-converter.md","line":212,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. The team maintains a single-chemistry-stock for the cross-referenced families and"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-440c.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-d2.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-d2.md","line":34,"text":"**See also:** [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/) for the differences that matter in service, [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/) for selecti"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-m2-hss.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-m2-hss.md","line":33,"text":"**See also:** [M2 vs M4 HSS](/m2-vs-m4-hss/), [HSS vs Carbide](/hss-vs-carbide/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-skd11.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-skd11.md","line":33,"text":"**See also:** [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/materials-encyclopedia-tungsten-carbide.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/o1.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/o1.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-corrugated-slitter.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-corrugated-slitter.md","line":104,"text":"For a written corrugated slitter specification, send the flute type, line speed, substrate batch and current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com)"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-corrugated-slitter.md","line":108,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, packaging manufacturers and OEMs across four continents, wit"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-crusher-blade.md","line":16,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-crusher-blade.md","line":105,"text":"For broader impact-loaded blade selection, see [How to choose a granulator knife](/selection-guide-granulator-knife/) and [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-crusher-blade.md","line":107,"text":"For a written crusher blade specification, send the crusher type, substrate, throughput, current blade spec and current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-indu"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-crusher-blade.md","line":111,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to recyclers, quarries and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-doctor-blade-printing.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-doctor-blade-printing.md","line":105,"text":"For broader selection guidance, see [How to choose a slitter blade for paper converting](/selection-guide-paper-converting/) and [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-se"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-doctor-blade-printing.md","line":107,"text":"For a written doctor-blade specification, send the process, substrate, ink chemistry, line speed and current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com)"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-doctor-blade-printing.md","line":111,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to printers, coaters and OEMs across four continents, with active distribut"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-foam-rubber-cutting.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-foam-rubber-cutting.md","line":99,"text":"For broader selection guidance, see [How to choose a slitter blade for paper converting](/selection-guide-paper-converting/) and [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-se"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-foam-rubber-cutting.md","line":101,"text":"For a written foam or rubber cutting specification, send the substrate family, density, line speed, current blade spec and current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-foam-rubber-cutting.md","line":105,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to foam, rubber and gasket manufacturers across four continents, with a ded"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-granulator-knife.md","line":16,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-granulator-knife.md","line":109,"text":"For the broader five-factor selection framework, see [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/). For a runnable steel grade cross-reference, see [Materi"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-granulator-knife.md","line":111,"text":"For a written granulator-knife specification, send the part drawing, the polymer, the filler content, the contamination profile and the current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailt"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-granulator-knife.md","line":115,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-paper-converting.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-paper-converting.md","line":109,"text":"## Field cases from the KAIPU shop"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-paper-converting.md","line":125,"text":"For the broader five-factor selection framework, see [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/). For a runnable steel grade cross-reference, see [Materi"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-paper-converting.md","line":127,"text":"For a written paper-converting specification, send the part drawing, the substrate, the line speed and the current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industria"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-paper-converting.md","line":131,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-shear-blade-plate-steel.md","line":15,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-shear-blade-plate-steel.md","line":155,"text":"For the broader five-factor selection framework, see [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/). For the M2 vs M4 HSS head-to-head, see [M2 vs M4 HSS](/"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-shear-blade-plate-steel.md","line":157,"text":"For a written shear-blade specification, send the part drawing, the substrate, the plate thickness and the current service life to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industria"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-shear-blade-plate-steel.md","line":161,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":17,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":23,"text":"Stainless steel is the worst-case substrate for an industrial blade: it work-hardens at the cut, the austenitic grades gall to the tool, and the wrong blade grade loses its edge in a single shift. The"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":37,"text":"If you can answer those five, the grade drops out. Below is the substrate-by-substrate map we use at KAIPU when an RFQ arrives with a stainless-steel substrate."},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":116,"text":"## Field cases from the KAIPU shop"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":145,"text":"For a copy of the broader five-factor selection framework, see [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/). For a runnable cross-reference of the steel g"},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":147,"text":"For a written stainless-cutting specification, send the part drawing, the substrate, the thickness and the line speed to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com) or "},{"file":"src/data/post/selection-guide-stainless-steel.md","line":151,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents."},{"file":"src/data/post/t1.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/t1.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/t15.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/t15.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-burr-growth.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-burr-growth.md","line":134,"text":"For a written burr growth diagnosis, send the worn knife, the line log, and the substrate batch records to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com) or use the [reque"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-burr-growth.md","line":140,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-edge-chipping-paper-slitter.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-edge-chipping-paper-slitter.md","line":128,"text":"For a written chip diagnosis on a specific knife, send the chipped knife, the line log and the substrate batch records to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com) or"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-edge-chipping-paper-slitter.md","line":134,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-premature-wear.md","line":15,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-premature-wear.md","line":185,"text":"For a written troubleshooting review, send the worn knife, the line parameters and the substrate spec to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com) or use the [request"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-premature-wear.md","line":189,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents."},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-shear-blade-cracking.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-shear-blade-cracking.md","line":128,"text":"For a written diagnosis on a cracked shear blade, send the cracked blade, the line log, the plate batch records and the blade gap measurement to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@k"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-shear-blade-cracking.md","line":134,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents, with a dedicated "},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-thermal-damage.md","line":14,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-thermal-damage.md","line":107,"text":"For a written thermal damage diagnosis, send the discoloured knife, the line log, the substrate spec and the current cooling configuration to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaip"},{"file":"src/data/post/troubleshooting-thermal-damage.md","line":111,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified.*"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg10.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg10.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/yg15.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg15.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6.md","line":13,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6.md","line":33,"text":"**See also: [D2 vs SKD11 comparison](/d2-vs-skd11/), [Material Grade Converter](/material-grade-converter/), [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/)."},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6x-vs-yg8-carbide.md","line":18,"text":"author: 'KAIPU Engineering'"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6x-vs-yg8-carbide.md","line":20,"text":"description: 'YG6X vs YG8 cemented tungsten carbide for industrial machine knives. Cobalt content, hardness, toughness, wear resistance, ISO 513 classification, substrate fit. Side-by-side comparison "},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6x-vs-yg8-carbide.md","line":154,"text":"For a copy of the full five-factor selection method, see [The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework](/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/). For a coating comparison to extend carbide life fur"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6x-vs-yg8-carbide.md","line":156,"text":"For a written YG6X / YG8 quotation, send the part drawing, the substrate and the impact profile to [engineering@kaipu-industrial.com](mailto:engineering@kaipu-industrial.com) or use the [request-a-quo"},{"file":"src/data/post/yg6x-vs-yg8-carbide.md","line":160,"text":"*KAIPU Engineering is the technical team at KAIPU Industrial Blades, in operation since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified. Ships to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents.*"},{"file":"src/data/product/bed-knife-tissue.md","line":15,"text":"title: 'D2 Bed Knife for Tissue Converting —HRC 60, 18° Clearance | KAIPU'"},{"file":"src/data/product/slitter-blade.md","line":17,"text":"title: 'Circular Slitting Blade Ø250 mm OD | KAIPU Industrial Blades'"},{"file":"src/data/quality-faqs.ts","line":15,"text":"q: 'Is KAIPU ISO 9001 certified, and how long has the certificate been valid?',"},{"file":"src/data/quality-faqs.ts","line":16,"text":"a: 'Yes. KAIPU has held ISO 9001:2015 certification continuously since 2001, with the most recent surveillance audit completed in 2026. The certificate, quality manual and a sample CMM inspection repo"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/citations.log.yaml","line":2,"text":"# KAIPU Citation Log (V1.0 — Empty)"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/entities.yaml","line":2,"text":"# KAIPU Entities (V1.0 Seed)"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/entities.yaml","line":77,"text":"url_slug: /blog/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/entities.yaml","line":87,"text":"notes: 'Derived from src/data/post/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework.md.'"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/prompts.seed.yaml","line":2,"text":"# KAIPU Prompt Seed (V1.0)"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/queries.seed.yaml","line":2,"text":"# KAIPU Query Seed (V1.0)"},{"file":"src/data/query-acquisition/queries.seed.yaml","line":493,"text":"target_url: /blog/kaipu-5-fa