kaipu: 'CMM measurement + 2D/3D drawing approval',"},{"file":"src/data/_products-overview.ts","line":156,"text":"kaipu: 'Named engineer, end-to-end',"},{"file":"src/data/_products-overview.ts","line":161,"text":"kaipu: 'Quoted lead time = delivered lead time',"},{"file":"src/data/_templates/query-acquisition/README.md","line":43,"text":"KAIPU 实例化首批种子见 `src/data/query-acquisition/`。"},{"file":"src/lib/schema.ts","line":179,"text":"* Author defaults to \"KAIPU Engineering\" Organization — the engineering"},{"file":"src/lib/schema.ts","line":189,"text":"*   author: { name: 'KAIPU Engineering', url: 'https://www.machine-knives.net/about/' },"},{"file":"src/lib/schema.ts","line":213,"text":": { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU Engineering' };"},{"file":"src/lib/schema.ts","line":221,"text":": { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU' };"},{"file":"src/pages/about.astro","line":11,"text":"title: 'About KAIPU',"},{"file":"src/pages/about.astro","line":13,"text":"'KAIPU Industrial Blades —precision machine knife manufacturer since 1998. ISO 9001 certified factory, in-house heat treatment and PVD coating.',"},{"file":"src/pages/about.astro","line":17,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/about/manufacturing-facility-overview.webp\" alt=\"KAIPU manufacturing facility overview (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"eager\" />'"},{"file":"src/pages/about.astro","line":22,"text":"tagline=\"About KAIPU\""},{"file":"src/pages/blog/index.astro","line":58,"text":"'Material comparisons, selection methodology, maintenance playbooks, troubleshooting case studies and AI-cited reference tables — written by KAIPU engineers.',"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/index.astro","line":75,"text":"subtitle=\"Material comparisons, selection methodology, maintenance playbooks, troubleshooting case studies and AI-cited reference tables — written by KAIPU engineers for line operators, buyers and pro"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/index.astro","line":79,"text":"? `Reference entries in the ${category.title} topic — concise, AI-citable definitions curated by KAIPU engineering.`"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/index.astro","line":81,"text":"? `${category.title} — a side-by-side reference table for industrial blade specification. Curated and maintained by KAIPU engineering.`"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/index.astro","line":85,"text":"title: `${category.title} | KAIPU Blog`,"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/index.astro","line":137,"text":"Send a drawing, a worn sample, or a written specification. KAIPU engineering responds with material grade,"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/[slug].astro","line":75,"text":"title: `${pageProps.category.title} — Page ${pageProps.pageNumber} | KAIPU Blog`,"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/[slug].astro","line":136,"text":"name: postProps.post.author || 'KAIPU Engineering',"},{"file":"src/pages/blog/[category]/[slug].astro","line":141,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/contact.astro","line":14,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/contact/engineering-team-drawing.webp\" alt=\"KAIPU engineering team reviewing a customer drawing (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"e"},{"file":"src/pages/contact.astro","line":91,"text":"'I agree to be contacted by KAIPU Industrial Blades regarding this enquiry. My details will not be shared with third parties.',"},{"file":"src/pages/index.astro","line":13,"text":"title: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades — Precision Machine Knives',"},{"file":"src/pages/index.astro","line":19,"text":"'<img src=\"/homepage/kaipu-precision-industrial-blade-manufacturing.webp\" alt=\"KAIPU precision industrial blade manufacturing with CNC grinding equipment\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024"},{"file":"src/pages/index.astro","line":24,"text":"tagline=\"KAIPU Industrial Blades\""},{"file":"src/pages/index.astro","line":274,"text":"<p class=\"text-center text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400 mt-8\">Numbers above are typical. <strong>vs Typical job-shop piece-price schemes:</strong> an alternative to per-piece pricing, KAIPU's re-"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":14,"text":"'KAIPU Industrial Blades has supplied precision machine knives to six core industries since 1998. ISO 9001:2015 certified, materials per ASTM A681 / DIN 1.2379 / JIS SKD11, in-house heat treatment and"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":18,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/industries/index/six-sectors-overview.webp\" alt=\"Industries served by KAIPU —six sectors (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"eager\" /"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":26,"text":"name: 'Industries served by KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":45,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":181,"text":"'Yes. Send us a worn sample and we will measure the current edge geometry, regrind to OEM or KAIPU specification, and return a regrind report with edge-life expectations. We regrind blades from most m"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":198,"text":"'Every KAIPU blade is qualified against a proprietary 5-Factor framework before it leaves the floor: (1) substrate classification against ASTM A681 / DIN 1.2379 grade tables, (2) edge geometry on a 0."},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":211,"text":"\"url\": \"https://www.machine-knives.net/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/\","},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":213,"text":"\"author\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"KAIPU Industrial Blades\" }"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":220,"text":"\"name\": \"How to specify an industrial blade for KAIPU\","},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":237,"text":"subtitle=\"Each industry carries its own cutting mechanics —web tension, abrasive wear, hygiene grade, throughput. We tune blade geometry and steel grade to match. KAIPU has supplied converters, recycl"},{"file":"src/pages/industries/index.astro","line":272,"text":"KAIPU blade envelope, at a glance"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":98,"text":"KAIPU Industrial Blades has been manufacturing precision knives for printing, packaging, paper, food"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":118,"text":"alt=\"[PLACEHOLDER: KAIPU factory floor — CNC grinding of an industrial circular blade]\""},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":125,"text":"<figcaption class=\"lp-hero-cap\">[PLACEHOLDER: KAIPU factory — city, country]</figcaption>"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":247,"text":"*   - what KAIPU changed"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":254,"text":"straight D2 knives. KAIPU replaced them with tungsten-carbide-tipped blades (YG6X) and refined the grind"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":262,"text":"[PLACEHOLDER: 6&nbsp;mm SS304 swing-beam shear was burr-ing above 0.15&nbsp;mm after 5,000 cycles. KAIPU"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":273,"text":"from paper, film, foil, food or recycling where KAIPU has a real win.]"},{"file":"src/pages/lp/quote.astro","line":338,"text":"replaced our European supplier with KAIPU on the corrugated line in 2024. Blade life went from 12 hours to"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":101,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":113,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":161,"text":"name: 'How to order a custom industrial blade from KAIPU',"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":192,"text":"subtitle={`KAIPU has engineered industrial blades in-house since 1998. ${activeProductCount} standard SKU${activeProductCount === 1 ? '' : 's'} are currently published across ${familyCount} product fa"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":200,"text":"subtitle=\"If any of these sound familiar, you are in the right place. Every KAIPU order is engineering-led, not a SKU match.\""},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":315,"text":"<!-- Comparison: KAIPU vs catalog-only suppliers -->"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":319,"text":"<h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading\">KAIPU vs Catalog-Only Suppliers</h2>"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":321,"text":"Seven criteria that distinguish an engineering-led manufacturer from a SKU drop-shipper. Source for every KAIPU"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":328,"text":"<caption class=\"sr-only\">Side-by-side comparison of KAIPU and catalog-only blade suppliers.</caption>"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":332,"text":"<th scope=\"col\" class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-primary\">KAIPU</th>"},{"file":"src/pages/products/index.astro","line":343,"text":"<td class=\"px-4 py-3\">{row.kaipu}</td>"},{"file":"src/pages/products/[...slug].astro","line":233,"text":"author: { name: 'KAIPU Engineering', url: SITE_URL + '/about/' },"},{"file":"src/pages/products/[...slug].astro","line":234,"text":"publisher: { name: 'KAIPU' },"},{"file":"src/pages/products/[...slug].astro","line":264,"text":"<Layout metadata={{ title: `${categoryPageTitle} — KAIPU`, description: categoryPageSubtitle }} breadcrumb={categoryBreadcrumb}>"},{"file":"src/pages/products/[...slug].astro","line":349,"text":"<Layout metadata={{ title: `${productEntry.data.title} — KAIPU`, description: productEntry.data.excerpt ?? '' }} breadcrumb={productBreadcrumb}>"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":21,"text":"'KAIPU quality system: ISO 9001:2015 since 2001, 5-stage quality gate, HEXAGON Global S CMM, hardness mapping per Rockwell C, EN 10204 3.1 mill certificates, PPAP / ISIR on request, Cpk ≥ 1.33 audited"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":25,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/quality/cmm-inspection-lab.webp\" alt=\"KAIPU CMM inspection lab and quality documentation (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"eager\" /"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":161,"text":"{ kpi: 'ISO 9001:2015 certified', kaipu: 'Yes, since 2001', typical: 'Varies; often not certified' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":162,"text":"{ kpi: 'Mill certificate per EN 10204 3.1', kaipu: 'Shipped with every batch', typical: 'Only on request, surcharge' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":163,"text":"{ kpi: 'CMM inspection', kaipu: 'Every dimension on drawing', typical: 'Critical dims only' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":164,"text":"{ kpi: 'CMM repeatability', kaipu: '±0.003 mm (HEXAGON Global S)', typical: '±0.01 mm typical' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":165,"text":"{ kpi: 'Hardness mapping', kaipu: '3-point Rockwell C per blade', typical: 'Single spot check' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":166,"text":"{ kpi: 'Surface roughness on edge', kaipu: '≤Ra 0.2 µm, profilometer', typical: 'Visual, no instrument' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":167,"text":"{ kpi: 'Cpk on critical dims', kaipu: '≥ 1.33, quarterly audit', typical: 'Not tracked' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":168,"text":"{ kpi: 'PPAP / ISIR package', kaipu: 'On request, AIAG-compliant', typical: 'Not offered' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":169,"text":"{ kpi: 'Coating adhesion test', kaipu: 'VDI 3198 per batch', typical: 'Not tested' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":170,"text":"{ kpi: 'Document retention', kaipu: '10 yr per ISO 9001 §7.5', typical: '1— yr' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":171,"text":"{ kpi: 'Customer audit support', kaipu: 'On-site, twice monthly', typical: 'By appointment, limited' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":172,"text":"{ kpi: 'NCR turnaround', kaipu: '8D within 5 business days', typical: 'Ad hoc' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":179,"text":"headline: 'Quality & Certifications at KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":184,"text":"author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades', url: siteUrl + '/' },"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":187,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":206,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Industrial Blades',"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":229,"text":"name: 'How KAIPU inspects and releases a finished industrial blade',"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":268,"text":"subtitle=\"KAIPU has run an ISO 9001:2015 quality system since 2001. Every blade we ship carries a documented chain from incoming steel to your dock —CMM report, mill certificate, hardness mapping and "},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":315,"text":"Six published standards define how KAIPU specifies, inspects and certifies every blade. They are referenced on every quote and on every dispatch note —not as marketing language but as the actual numbe"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":409,"text":"<h2 class=\"mb-2 text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl\">KAIPU QA vs Typical Job Shop</h2>"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":420,"text":"<th class=\"px-4 py-3\">KAIPU</th>"},{"file":"src/pages/quality.astro","line":428,"text":"<td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted dark:text-slate-300\">{row.kaipu}</td>"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":20,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/services/manufacturing-service-operations.webp\" alt=\"KAIPU manufacturing service operations (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"eager"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":34,"text":"subtitle={`KAIPU operates the design office, tool-room, heat treatment, surface coating and quality lab under one roof. ${yearsInBusiness} years of industrial-blade manufacturing since ${foundedYear},"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":70,"text":"<h2 class=\"mb-2 text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl\">KAIPU vs Typical Job Shop</h2>"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":72,"text":"How KAIPU compares to a typical CNC job shop or overseas OEM. Compared with the alternatives, the difference is in-house control of every critical step —from steel sourcing to final QA documentation."},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":80,"text":"<th class=\"px-4 py-3 font-semibold\">KAIPU</th>"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":198,"text":"provider: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU' },"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":213,"text":"author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU Engineering Team', url: siteUrl + '/about/' },"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":214,"text":"publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'KAIPU' },"},{"file":"src/pages/services.astro","line":225,"text":"name: 'KAIPU Order Process: From RFQ to Delivery',"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":13,"text":"'KAIPU supplies precision machine knives to six core industries since 1998. ISO 9001 certified, D2 / M2 / SKD11 / carbide materials, ASTM A681 / DIN 1.2379 / JIS SKD11 grades, in-house heat treatment "},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":17,"text":"'<img src=\"/images/solutions/industry-applications-overview.webp\" alt=\"Six industry applications served by KAIPU (placeholder)\" class=\"mx-auto rounded-md w-full\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" loading=\"eag"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":40,"text":"\"name\": \"KAIPU Industrial Blades\","},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":105,"text":"\"text\": \"KAIPU's engineering team reviews geometry, material, hardness target and operating speed. Response includes specification, indicative price and lead time. Unworkable drawings are flagged with"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":134,"text":"// Page-level JSON-LD: BlogPosting cross-link. The \"KAIPU 5-Factor Selection"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":142,"text":"\"The KAIPU 5-Factor Blade Selection Framework — How to Specify the Right Industrial Knife in 30 Minutes\","},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":143,"text":"\"url\": \"https://www.machine-knives.net/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/\","},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":146,"text":"\"author\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"KAIPU Engineering\" },"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":147,"text":"\"publisher\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"KAIPU Industrial Blades\" },"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":212,"text":"subtitle=\"Each industry carries its own cutting mechanics — web tension, abrasive wear, hygiene grade, throughput. We tune the blade geometry and steel grade to match. KAIPU has supplied converters, r"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":325,"text":"{/* ──────────────────────────────────────── KAIPU 5-Factor Method (inline summary — full version in /kaipu-5-factor-...) ──────────────────────────────────────── */}"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":329,"text":"title=\"The KAIPU 5-Factor Selection Method — Five Dimensions of Blade Specification\""},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":362,"text":"<a href=\"/kaipu-5-factor-blade-selection-framework/\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":363,"text":"Read the KAIPU 5-Factor Framework →"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":457,"text":"and a KAIPU heat-treatment record. The certificate names the heat lot, the steel grade and the actual hardness"},{"file":"src/pages/solutions.astro","line":523,"text":"'Yes. KAIPU exports to converters, recyclers and OEMs across four continents — North America, Europe, Latin America and Asia-Pacific. We ship EXW, FOB, CIF and DDP. Standard packing is vacuum-sealed f"},{"file":"public/pricing.md","line":1,"text":"# Pricing —KAIPU Industrial Blades"}]}
